                                "sense_id": "7f76470d-689d-3f2f-9155-14d9a2f7d685",
                                "text": "Het communisme van Babeuf dateert van het Directoire, generaties voor Karl Marx' Manifest.",
                                "translation": "Babeuf's communism dates from the Directoire, generations before Karl Marx's Manifesto.",
                                "english": "Babeuf's communism dates from the Directoire, generations before Karl Marx's Manifesto."
